The '''Redstone Miner''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Pigmen's Den}}. They grant up to four [[Accessory Bag]] slots in exchange for increasing amounts of Redstone.

== Quest ==
Interacting with the '''Redstone Miner''' for the first time starts the {{Quest|The Redstone Maniac}} quest. Provided the player has reached {{Green|250}} [[Redstone Dust]] collection, the NPC asks them for {{Item|Redstone Dust|amount=128}}. The player will receive an additional [[Accessory Bag]] slot, upon giving the items to the Redstone Miner. This can be repeated three more times, with [[File:Redstone.png|link=Redstone Dust|26px]] {{Green|256}}, {{Green|512}} and {{Green|1024}} redstone respectively for a total of {{Item|Redstone Dust|amount=1920}} or 30 stacks.

