== Trivia ==
*The '''Redstone Miner''' is the brother of the {{NPCSprite|Lapis Miner}}.

== Bugs ==
*If the player reaches {{coll|Redstone Dust|2}} before first talking to the '''Redstone Miner''', they must swap lobbies after the first interaction for it to recognize that they already have the collection.

